{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5ee96f8876b22aa260077904c5f294d321ea47b97806a3df0d7ae0970e0172",
      "text": "我这边也是，来得不是时候，实在抱歉。\n请容我当面再正式向两位说明一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b8d43fb6a52beab38daeb3982f3c7cee813d3bee5d2ef3cf75014cb3fef7ebe",
      "text": "很久以前我就在电视和杂志上看到过闪闪发光的两位。\n前几天，当真正见到悠介先生时……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfeaf2f6ed2908a9c20cb987e3645c7eccfb839a36bb378106ab215ec2e446d",
      "text": "（突然说什么当偶像……到底在胡言乱语什么啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a2c3b26038c419a649a7b0eebfe2312fea9d45afc2a6948c136457171003ae5",
      "text": "（你又一个人擅自做决定了吗？\n我的事情……对你来说根本怎样都无所谓吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771057cdeffcd1458057c02cb7065839fbaa887eaf173170ddcc763d23642e2a",
      "text": "那个啊，享介。虽然顺序有点搞反了。\n但要是想到还有这样一条路，不觉得很有意思吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde464fa5dc1568d23eeb8652d5007730c1eaa904e966a5be5410e766e340a5c",
      "text": "……每次都是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cab7ca2c531f19c69e7628c80f44b667ae85df41aad33c20f5e070e99ffb1112",
      "text": "悠介每次都是这样！！\n只顾着自己想做的事，完全不看周围！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af5e8b55c3eebf15cd5dc3bc0810e0a987dc0f1ffdc2f80166551d83f105191b",
      "text": "我的心情……你哪怕有一点……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f20af647107f1883a208aaca5711a303ce7f0cdd951ce88f2e884144e000766f",
      "text": "享介！！等一下……呜！可恶，脚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f91417a78e2ab62f455113c7770f9998477f8de9ed4867a17371817bd802e359",
      "text": "悠介先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
